WEBVTT

00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:04.060
<b>Science Lab</b>

00:00:04.460 --> 00:00:06.410
<b>Hmm...</b>

00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:11.930
<b>I'm back!</b>

00:00:11.930 --> 00:00:13.230
<b>Found anything out?</b>

00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:16.100
<b>I don't know the specifics,</b>

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:20.430
<b>but I can say for certain that it's not of this world.</b>

00:00:20.810 --> 00:00:22.160
<b>Not of this world?!</b>

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:24.140
<b>Where did you get this?</b>

00:00:25.010 --> 00:00:28.960
<b>I got this from a ball of light when I transformed,</b>

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:34.410
<b>and I got this from a man I met at a jewelry stand at the Clover Tower.</b>

00:00:36.620 --> 00:00:38.860
<b>Do you know what this is?</b>

00:00:38.860 --> 00:00:39.790
<b>Nope.</b>

00:00:40.190 --> 00:00:42.420
<b>We came here just after we were born,</b>

00:00:42.420 --> 00:00:43.490
<b>so we don't know.</b>

00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:46.620
<b>Well <i>that</i> explains a few things.</b>

00:00:46.620 --> 00:00:48.000
<b>How rude!</b>

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:51.090
<b>We're doing the best we can here!</b>

00:00:51.090 --> 00:00:52.200
<b>Oh, I'm sorry.</b>

00:00:52.530 --> 00:00:53.750
<b>You're right.</b>

00:00:53.750 --> 00:00:58.170
<b>We've learned a lot thanks to your cooperation</b>

00:00:58.780 --> 00:00:59.840
<b>Like what?</b>

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:05.240
<b>Like how the Cure Lovies is the source of the Precure's power.</b>

00:01:06.220 --> 00:01:08.880
<b>I'd wager that the more Lovies one finds,</b>

00:01:08.880 --> 00:01:12.020
<b>the more abilities a Precure can use.</b>

00:01:14.190 --> 00:01:17.130
<b>The Cure Lovies is really something.</b>

00:01:19.490 --> 00:01:20.010
<b>Huh?</b>

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:23.350
<b>Oh, you two are still here?</b>

00:01:24.140 --> 00:01:25.200
<b>I'm sorry!</b>

00:01:25.640 --> 00:01:28.900
<b>We had something we just had to investigate today.</b>

00:01:30.170 --> 00:01:32.380
<b>The teachers already left.</b>

00:01:32.380 --> 00:01:34.150
<b>So if you don't clean up in three minutes,</b>

00:01:34.640 --> 00:01:36.230
<b>you'll get locked in.</b>

00:01:36.230 --> 00:01:36.950
<b>Oh no!</b>

00:01:36.950 --> 00:01:38.890
<b>Wait a second!</b>

00:01:43.850 --> 00:01:48.220
<b>Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!</b>

00:01:48.220 --> 00:01:50.690
<b>The world is like a merry-go-round</b>

00:01:51.060 --> 00:01:53.560
<b>Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1</b>

00:01:53.860 --> 00:01:55.590
<b>Every day it sparkles</b>

00:01:55.760 --> 00:01:59.300
<b>Dokidoki Precure</b>

00:02:00.770 --> 00:02:06.170
<b>I wear my new clothes and walk a path I've never walked before</b>

00:02:06.770 --> 00:02:11.840
<b>My heart races and I greet the scenery around me</b>

00:02:12.010 --> 00:02:17.480
<b>The color of the flower on the corner will be my lucky color for the day</b>

00:02:18.020 --> 00:02:22.920
<b>Leave it all to me, because today I'm blessed</b>

00:02:23.790 --> 00:02:28.630
<b>If your friends are in trouble</b>

00:02:28.830 --> 00:02:37.500
<b>isn't it normal to help them?</b>

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:39.170
<b>Happy lucky Precure</b>

00:02:39.170 --> 00:02:41.570
<b>Only Precure makes my heart pound</b>

00:02:41.810 --> 00:02:44.410
<b>Our happy love will change the world</b>

00:02:44.680 --> 00:02:47.210
<b>What's more than just cute</b>

00:02:47.510 --> 00:02:51.080
<b>is our promise between girls</b>

00:02:51.880 --> 00:02:57.120
<b>I will fight for you and believe in you</b>

00:02:57.160 --> 00:03:03.030
<b>Gather your unparalleled tenderness, yeah, Precure</b>

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:15.470
<b>The Ultimate Partner Has Arrived!

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:15.470
<b>The Ultimate Partner Has Arrived!

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:22.140
<b>All else aside, I'm curious about this man who you said gave you the Lovies.</b>

00:03:22.860 --> 00:03:25.120
<b>This requires further investigation...</b>

00:03:27.470 --> 00:03:28.590
<b>Mana?</b>

