00:04:05.460 --> 00:04:06.430
<b>All right!</b>

00:04:06.800 --> 00:04:08.560
<b>I can't work on an empty stomach,</b>

00:04:08.560 --> 00:04:12.190
<b>so how about we go to my house and work out a plan over dinner?</b>

00:04:12.730 --> 00:04:13.700
<b>No objections!</b>

00:04:13.700 --> 00:04:14.800
<b>Yay!</b>

00:04:14.800 --> 00:04:17.970
<b>Oh, let me make a call while we have the chance.</b>

00:04:19.390 --> 00:04:21.000
<b>What's she doing?</b>

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:23.070
<b>Rikka's mom is a doctor,</b>

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:25.800
<b>so she gets home really late pretty often.</b>

00:04:25.800 --> 00:04:28.650
<b>That's why Rikka's calling her.</b>

00:04:33.680 --> 00:04:35.290
<b>Now then, eat up!</b>

00:04:36.990 --> 00:04:38.360
<b>Don't mind if we do!</b>

00:04:42.140 --> 00:04:43.760
<b>My taste buds are in heaven!</b>

00:04:44.310 --> 00:04:47.200
<b>Mr. Aida, your cooking's definitely the best!</b>

00:04:47.200 --> 00:04:48.580
<b>Good to hear.</b>

00:04:48.580 --> 00:04:51.210
<b>That's my dad for you!</b>

00:04:51.210 --> 00:04:51.940
<b>Hmph!</b>

00:04:52.670 --> 00:04:55.500
<b>Only half as good as my work, I tell ya.</b>

00:04:57.380 --> 00:05:00.250
<b>Want to put that to the test, Dad?</b>

00:05:00.550 --> 00:05:02.200
<b>You needn't ask!</b>

00:05:03.420 --> 00:05:06.770
<b>If you think I'm the same chef I once was, you're sorely mistaken.</b>

00:05:06.770 --> 00:05:08.090
<b>Why you whippersnapper—</b>

00:05:08.190 --> 00:05:10.060
<b>Now now, settle down.</b>

00:05:10.710 --> 00:05:13.450
<b>We have customers waiting, so save it for later.</b>

00:05:13.450 --> 00:05:16.830
<b>I'm sorry for always eating up your food.</b>

00:05:17.140 --> 00:05:18.670
<b>I can't thank you enough.</b>

00:05:19.420 --> 00:05:21.430
<b>I keep telling you not to worry about it!</b>

00:05:21.430 --> 00:05:24.040
<b>With neighbors, it's all about give and take!</b>

00:05:24.700 --> 00:05:25.920
<b>Welcome!</b>

00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:28.030
<b>Take your time.</b>

00:05:28.030 --> 00:05:30.350
<b>We've got plenty left if you want seconds.</b>

00:05:30.710 --> 00:05:32.290
<b>Thank you very much!</b>

00:05:32.810 --> 00:05:35.770
diner

00:05:32.810 --> 00:05:35.770
<b>Pig's Tail</b>

00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:37.970
<b>Thank you for dinner.</b>

00:05:37.970 --> 00:05:39.610
<b>You're welcome for dinner.</b>

00:05:40.200 --> 00:05:42.920
<b>You two get along great.</b>

00:05:42.920 --> 00:05:46.020
<b>So how about you become a Precure too, Rikka?</b>

00:05:46.020 --> 00:05:47.080
<b>Huh?</b>

00:05:47.080 --> 00:05:48.360
<b>Well, um...</b>

00:05:48.890 --> 00:05:52.040
<b>you're really smart and kind,</b>

00:05:52.040 --> 00:05:56.010
<b>so I thought it'd be nice if you were my partner...</b>

00:05:56.010 --> 00:05:57.200
<b>That sounds great!</b>

00:05:57.540 --> 00:06:00.670
<b>With you by my side, we'd be unbeatable!</b>

00:06:01.090 --> 00:06:03.880
<b>M-Me? A Precure?</b>

00:06:03.880 --> 00:06:05.130
<b>And her name?</b>

00:06:05.130 --> 00:06:06.550
<b>Let's see...</b>

00:06:06.550 --> 00:06:08.510
<b>I'm already Heart, so...</b>

00:06:09.510 --> 00:06:11.480
<b>how about Cure Dia?</b>

00:06:11.480 --> 00:06:12.220
<b>Yeah!</b>

00:06:12.560 --> 00:06:14.410
<b>Hold on a minute!</b>

00:06:14.410 --> 00:06:18.750
<b>I'm not nearly as athletic as you are,</b>

00:06:18.750 --> 00:06:21.230
<b>and I'm bad at taking center stage.</b>

00:06:22.180 --> 00:06:26.420
<b>Those frilly clothes would look terrible on me, too...</b>

00:06:26.420 --> 00:06:30.770
<b>Besides, you can't become a Precure just by asking to be one!</b>

00:06:30.770 --> 00:06:32.040
<b>Don't worry!</b>

00:06:32.040 --> 00:06:35.040
<b>If I can do it, you can too.</b>

00:06:35.360 --> 00:06:38.050
<b>Nobody has a stronger sense of justice than you.</b>

00:06:38.050 --> 00:06:40.660
<b>Everyone trusts you and relies on you.</b>

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:45.020
<b>I know what it takes to be a Precure.</b>

00:06:45.930 --> 00:06:48.000
<b>But I can't do it.</b>

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:50.480
<b>It's all I can do to look after myself.</b>

00:06:50.480 --> 00:06:52.050
<b>That's not true!</b>

00:06:52.050 --> 00:06:54.350
<b>You're always there to help me.</b>

00:06:57.140 --> 00:06:58.200
<b>Thank you.</b>

00:06:59.190 --> 00:07:00.160
<b>Rikka!</b>

00:07:00.160 --> 00:07:01.400
<b>Don't worry!</b>

00:07:01.680 --> 00:07:04.640
<b>I'll be your backup just like I always have.</b>

00:07:05.290 --> 00:07:09.790
<b>Tomorrow, let's go look for that man who gave you the Lovies.</b>

00:07:09.790 --> 00:07:10.610
<b>Good night!</b>

00:07:14.020 --> 00:07:15.280
<b>She got away.</b>

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:19.150
<b>I'm back.</b>

00:07:19.440 --> 00:07:20.230
<b>Hm?</b>

00:07:23.820 --> 00:07:24.860
<b>It's from Daddy!</b>

00:07:25.780 --> 00:07:28.190
<b>Rikka, are you well?</b>

00:07:28.190 --> 00:07:31.600
<b>Your daddy's in a place called Machu Picchu.</b>

00:07:31.600 --> 00:07:33.970
<b>The people here are really nice,</b>

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:37.120
<b>and sold me some great antiques on the cheap!</b>

00:07:38.260 --> 00:07:39.840
<b>Machu Picchu?</b>

00:07:40.740 --> 00:07:41.770
<b>Oh Daddy,</b>

00:07:42.050 --> 00:07:44.270
<b>you're supposed to be a professional photographer,</b>

00:07:44.270 --> 00:07:47.650
<b>so why not send a photo every now and then?</b>

00:07:49.730 --> 00:07:51.870
<b>To my beloved Daddy,</b>

00:07:51.870 --> 00:07:54.220
<b>Thank you for another unique souvenir.</b>

00:07:54.940 --> 00:07:56.950
<b>Mommy and I are doing well.</b>

00:07:57.960 --> 00:08:02.910
<b>Mommy's so busy with her hospital work that she can't even afford a sick day.</b>

00:08:04.870 --> 00:08:07.430
<b>I shouldn't write anything about the Precure.</b>

00:08:09.050 --> 00:08:11.860
<b>Last week was Greeting Week,</b>

00:08:11.860 --> 00:08:15.410
<b>so I woke up at six every morning to go to school.</b>

00:08:15.870 --> 00:08:18.320
<b>Mana's greetings were really loud,</b>

00:08:18.320 --> 00:08:20.800
<b>almost enough to wake the dead.</b>

00:08:20.800 --> 00:08:24.270
<b>Well then, Daddy, stay happy and healthy.</b>

00:08:24.270 --> 00:08:26.960
<b>I look forward to the tales of your travels.</b>

00:08:33.320 --> 00:08:34.580
<b>You seem tense.</b>

00:08:34.580 --> 00:08:35.730
<b>I darn well should be!</b>

00:08:36.240 --> 00:08:38.870
<b>I had two of my Selfishes beaten!</b>

00:08:41.240 --> 00:08:44.480
<b>You can't win the game if you let them get to you,</b>

00:08:44.480 --> 00:08:45.400
<b>Ira.</b>

00:08:45.800 --> 00:08:46.810
<b>Bel!</b>

00:08:46.810 --> 00:08:49.240
<b>Oh, you're here too?</b>

00:08:49.240 --> 00:08:51.370
<b>Orders from the top.</b>

00:08:51.370 --> 00:08:53.400
<b>I'm here to observe.</b>

00:08:53.400 --> 00:08:57.720
<b>How is a lone little girl giving you so much trouble?</b>

00:08:57.720 --> 00:08:59.560
<b>She's not alone!</b>

00:08:59.560 --> 00:09:01.190
<b>They've been recruiting.</b>

00:09:01.190 --> 00:09:02.690
<b>There are two Precures.</b>

00:09:02.970 --> 00:09:05.070
<b>Sounds difficult.</b>

00:09:05.070 --> 00:09:06.290
<b>Shall I lend a hand?</b>

00:09:06.290 --> 00:09:08.360
<b>I don't need you!</b>

00:09:08.360 --> 00:09:10.020
<b>No matter how many there are,</b>

00:09:10.020 --> 00:09:12.530
<b>I'll get rid of them all at once!</b>

00:09:20.780 --> 00:09:22.080
<b>A lovey letter?</b>

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:22.740
<b>Mana!</b>

00:09:23.120 --> 00:09:24.720
<b>It's my father!</b>

00:09:24.720 --> 00:09:26.980
<b>He'll get pouty if I don't reply.</b>

00:09:26.980 --> 00:09:30.370
<b>Getting a letter would make anyone happy!</b>

00:09:30.370 --> 00:09:33.450
<b>Especially when it's from your daughter!</b>

00:09:33.850 --> 00:09:36.580
<b>Then do you write to your dad?</b>

00:09:36.580 --> 00:09:41.440
<b>My dad never goes overseas like yours does,</b>

00:09:41.440 --> 00:09:44.660
<b>so there's no point in sending a letter across the hall.</b>

00:09:44.660 --> 00:09:50.100
<b>But isn't it wonderful how your dad's cooking can move people to tears?</b>

00:09:50.100 --> 00:09:53.580
<b>Why not write about how <i>wonderful</i> he is?</b>

00:09:53.580 --> 00:09:57.810
<b>But my dad's got nothing on your photography award-winning dad!</b>

00:10:03.310 --> 00:10:05.450
<b>Let's go, you two!</b>

00:10:05.450 --> 00:10:09.190
<b>Let's go talk to that man who gave you the Lovies!</b>

00:10:09.190 --> 00:10:12.090
<b>Okay, fine, we'll go see him—</b>

00:10:14.150 --> 00:10:14.950
<b>Mana!</b>

00:10:14.950 --> 00:10:16.220
<b>Ouch!</b>

00:10:16.220 --> 00:10:18.410
<b>I'm sorry. Are you all right?</b>

00:10:19.280 --> 00:10:21.180
<b>Sorry about that.</b>

00:10:21.840 --> 00:10:22.660
<b>Oh!</b>

00:10:22.660 --> 00:10:23.800
<b>Hello!</b>

00:10:24.680 --> 00:10:26.240
<b>Do you know him?</b>

00:10:26.240 --> 00:10:27.100
<b>This person...</b>

00:10:27.930 --> 00:10:30.480
<b>is the man who gave me the Lovies!</b>

00:10:31.220 --> 00:10:33.940
<b>We meet again, baby. {Not sure if creeper or channeling his inner Zepelli}{total pedo}</b>

00:10:48.520 --> 00:10:50.030
<b>What a pleasure.</b>

00:10:50.030 --> 00:10:54.170
<b>For me to happen upon you two on the day I open for business,</b>

00:10:54.520 --> 00:10:56.790
<b>why, it must be fate.</b>

00:10:56.790 --> 00:10:58.400
<b>Business?</b>

00:10:58.400 --> 00:11:00.090
<b>That's my shop.</b>

00:11:00.990 --> 00:11:03.110
<b>Wow, it's cute!</b>

00:11:03.990 --> 00:11:06.080
<b>Would you like to take a peek inside? {If there's a way to translate this without making him sound like a pedo, don't tell me.}{why would you want to do that}{that's why I said DON'T tell me}</b>

00:11:06.360 --> 00:11:07.510
<b>Totally!</b>

00:11:08.300 --> 00:11:09.830
<b>Wait!</b>

00:11:09.830 --> 00:11:10.890
<b>For what?</b>

00:11:10.890 --> 00:11:13.230
<b>There's clearly something strange here!</b>

00:11:13.230 --> 00:11:16.280
<b>I'm not buying that he just <i>happened</i> to open a store here.</b>

00:11:16.930 --> 00:11:19.560
<b>I think he may be following you! {Rikka's got good pedo senses.}</b>

00:11:19.560 --> 00:11:20.990
<b>No way!</b>

00:11:20.990 --> 00:11:22.120
<b>Something up?</b>

00:11:23.140 --> 00:11:25.830
<b>Just who are you?</b>

00:11:26.590 --> 00:11:28.070
<b>Oh, Rikka!</b>

00:11:28.070 --> 00:11:32.330
<b>Mana transformed with the power of this Lovies you gave her!</b>

00:11:32.760 --> 00:11:34.310
<b>Don't tell me you didn't know!</b>

00:11:35.280 --> 00:11:37.310
<b>Now say something!</b>

00:11:43.650 --> 00:11:45.120
<b>What's so funny?</b>

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:47.040
<b>Oh, I'm sorry.</b>

00:11:47.750 --> 00:11:50.070
<b>So, she "transformed"?</b>

00:11:50.830 --> 00:11:54.460
<b>I suppose such simple things make a huge difference to young girls.</b>

00:11:54.460 --> 00:11:56.290
<b>This isn't figurative!</b>

00:11:56.290 --> 00:11:59.230
<b>I really did transform, you know.</b>

00:11:59.550 --> 00:12:04.880
<b>The power of my Lovies is the power to discover a new you.</b>

00:12:04.880 --> 00:12:07.030
<b>To see you so pleased with it</b>

00:12:07.030 --> 00:12:08.410
<b>pleases me as well.</b>

00:12:09.300 --> 00:12:10.150
<b>Thank you.</b>

00:12:12.410 --> 00:12:13.500
<b>Stop that now.</b>

00:12:15.630 --> 00:12:16.710
<b>Oh, I know.</b>

00:12:16.710 --> 00:12:20.510
<b>I found this while sorting my inventory.</b>

00:12:21.970 --> 00:12:23.220
<b>Sharu! {Okay, I'm not going with Charles here until I see something official.}</b>

00:12:23.220 --> 00:12:25.180
<b>It looks just like Mana's Lovies!</b>

00:12:25.520 --> 00:12:26.730
<b>I'll give this to you.</b>

00:12:26.730 --> 00:12:28.380
<b>M-Me?</b>

00:12:28.380 --> 00:12:30.430
<b>Consider it a grand opening customer reward!</b>

00:12:35.340 --> 00:12:36.060
<b>That's it!</b>

00:12:42.790 --> 00:12:43.640
<b>Rikka?</b>

00:12:45.260 --> 00:12:46.370
<b>Are you okay?</b>

00:12:46.370 --> 00:12:48.160
<b>Y-Yeah.</b>

00:12:48.160 --> 00:12:49.850
<b>You seem to like it.</b>

00:12:54.300 --> 00:12:55.290
<b>Sorry...</b>

00:12:56.620 --> 00:12:57.960
<b>but I cannot accept this!</b>

00:12:58.720 --> 00:12:59.520
<b>Rikka...</b>

00:12:59.810 --> 00:13:02.140
<b>You're a stranger to me,</b>

00:13:02.140 --> 00:13:04.730
<b>so I will not take something from you without reason.</b>

00:13:04.730 --> 00:13:05.890
<b>And above all,</b>

00:13:05.890 --> 00:13:08.930
<b>I will not play to your whims!</b>

00:13:10.030 --> 00:13:12.900
<b>You seem to be misunderstanding something.</b>

00:13:13.580 --> 00:13:15.230
<b>Misunderstanding?</b>

00:13:15.230 --> 00:13:17.480
<b>I did not choose you.</b>

00:13:18.350 --> 00:13:21.380
<b>It was the Cure Lovies that did.</b>

00:13:22.060 --> 00:13:24.560
<b>However you use its power</b>

00:13:24.560 --> 00:13:27.360
<b>is up for none other than you to decide.</b>

00:13:32.130 --> 00:13:34.620
<b>Just send the love letter already!</b>

00:13:34.620 --> 00:13:35.620
<b>But...</b>

00:13:36.020 --> 00:13:37.990
<b>What do I do if he never responds?</b>

00:13:37.990 --> 00:13:41.030
<b>You can worry about that after you send it!</b>

00:13:41.030 --> 00:13:42.980
<b>Now, woman up!</b>

00:13:42.980 --> 00:13:44.990
<b>What? But, but...</b>

00:13:45.650 --> 00:13:47.360
<b>Love letters are such a load. {Here comes /a/ incarnate.}</b>

00:13:47.360 --> 00:13:50.430
<b>I've never even gotten a New Year's card from a girl.</b>

00:13:52.700 --> 00:13:55.110
<b>They oughta stop delivering mail period.</b>

00:13:59.090 --> 00:13:59.640
<b>Let's leave. {girls}</b>

00:13:59.640 --> 00:14:00.750
<b>Don't go there!</b>

00:14:00.750 --> 00:14:04.090
<b>Junk like that is the reason nobody likes me.</b>

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:08.620
<b>It's not your fault.</b>

00:14:08.620 --> 00:14:09.570
<b>Who was that?</b>

00:14:10.880 --> 00:14:12.030
<b>I will grant...</b>

00:14:12.550 --> 00:14:14.110
<b>your desire.</b>

00:14:25.190 --> 00:14:26.420
<b>Go berserk!</b>

00:14:26.420 --> 00:14:29.160
<b>Release the darkness in your heart!</b>

00:14:36.300 --> 00:14:38.590
<b>Whaddyawant! {Yeah, he doesn't say Jikochuu.}</b>

00:14:39.590 --> 00:14:42.150
<b>They oughta stop checkin' mail baaaaaahxes!</b>

00:14:42.960 --> 00:14:45.520
<b>Now come, Precure!</b>

00:14:45.520 --> 00:14:47.300
<b>This time, I'll send you to your graves!</b>

00:14:47.300 --> 00:14:49.650
<b>Letters're tasty.</b>

00:14:49.650 --> 00:14:51.240
<b>What are you doing?!</b>

00:14:51.240 --> 00:14:52.680
<b>I said, "Go berserk!"</b>

00:14:52.680 --> 00:14:54.410
<b>Postcards're tasty.</b>

00:14:54.730 --> 00:14:56.500
<b>You selfish jerk!</b>

00:14:58.720 --> 00:15:00.070
<b>Bad news!</b>

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:02.760
<b>What is it?</b>

00:15:02.760 --> 00:15:05.020
<b>I heard the heartbeat of a Selfish!</b>

00:15:06.200 --> 00:15:06.840
<b>Rikka!</b>

00:15:09.200 --> 00:15:11.090
<b>Your friend is calling for you.</b>

00:15:11.690 --> 00:15:13.050
<b>I'll be right back.</b>

00:15:13.660 --> 00:15:14.350
<b>Let's go!</b>

00:15:17.020 --> 00:15:18.890
<b>Selfiiiish!</b>

00:15:21.690 --> 00:15:25.070
<b>Junk mail's tasty.</b>

00:15:25.070 --> 00:15:26.280
<b>So it's a Selfish!</b>

00:15:26.700 --> 00:15:28.500
<b>It's eating the letters!</b>

00:15:28.500 --> 00:15:29.530
<b>Let's go, Sharuru!</b>

00:15:29.530 --> 00:15:30.740
<b>Gotcha!</b>

00:15:31.430 --> 00:15:33.000
<b>Sharuru!</b>

00:15:35.340 --> 00:15:37.850
<b>Precure Love Link!</b>

00:15:39.960 --> 00:15:40.640
<b>L-O-V-E!</b>

00:15:40.640 --> 00:15:41.410
<b>L-O-V-E!</b>

00:15:41.410 --> 00:15:42.070
<b>L-O-V-E!</b>

00:15:42.070 --> 00:15:42.940
<b>L-O-V-E!</b>

00:16:18.780 --> 00:16:20.170
<b>Brimming with love,</b>

00:16:20.820 --> 00:16:22.220
<b>Cure Heart!</b>

00:16:25.920 --> 00:16:28.000
<b>Oh poor goat who has lost his love,</b>

00:16:28.710 --> 00:16:30.280
<b>I, Cure Heart,</b>

00:16:30.280 --> 00:16:33.320
<b>will make your heart race once more!</b>

00:16:33.770 --> 00:16:35.680
<b>There you are, Precure!</b>

00:16:35.680 --> 00:16:37.810
<b>Selfish, go deal with her!</b>

00:16:37.810 --> 00:16:39.760
<b>Express mail's tasty.</b>

00:16:39.760 --> 00:16:42.080
<b>Listen to me for like five seconds!</b>

00:16:44.620 --> 00:16:45.420
<b>This is...</b>

00:16:45.420 --> 00:16:47.220
<b>Rikka's air mail!</b>

00:16:56.120 --> 00:16:59.930
<b>Give those letters baaaaaack! {Return of the crab}</b>

00:17:04.560 --> 00:17:05.680
<b>What's wrong?</b>

00:17:05.680 --> 00:17:07.330
<b>Fight, Cure Heart!</b>

00:17:08.460 --> 00:17:10.800
<b>These letters are filled with their writers' emotions...</b>

00:17:10.800 --> 00:17:12.940
<b>I will not allow you to eat them!</b>

00:17:14.910 --> 00:17:16.370
<b>Go, Selfish!</b>

00:17:16.370 --> 00:17:18.000
<b>Finish the Precure!</b>

00:17:18.000 --> 00:17:19.720
<b>Selfiiiish!</b>

00:17:20.000 --> 00:17:21.680
<b>Run, Cure Heart!</b>

00:17:22.910 --> 00:17:24.520
<b>I will not give them up!</b>

00:17:25.250 --> 00:17:26.320
<b>Mana!</b>

00:17:40.410 --> 00:17:43.510
<b>I was always with Mana.</b>

00:17:47.870 --> 00:17:51.840
<b>Every day was fun because Mana was there.</b>

00:17:52.170 --> 00:17:53.430
<b>They were brilliant!</b>

00:17:56.510 --> 00:17:59.010
