00:17:56.510 --> 00:17:59.010
<b>Student Council Candidate Application</b>

00:17:56.920 --> 00:17:59.010
<b>That time of year again?</b>

00:17:59.010 --> 00:18:01.850
<b>Next year's student council prez has gotta be Mana! {Is that you, Nikaido?}</b>

00:18:01.850 --> 00:18:02.760
<b>Totally.</b>

00:18:03.030 --> 00:18:04.740
<b>M-Me?</b>

00:18:04.740 --> 00:18:05.730
<b>Of course!</b>

00:18:05.730 --> 00:18:07.330
<b>Only you could handle it.</b>

00:18:07.330 --> 00:18:08.920
<b>Mana, you should run!</b>

00:18:08.920 --> 00:18:09.730
<b>Totally!</b>

00:18:10.040 --> 00:18:12.240
<b>Then join me, Rikka!</b>

00:18:12.870 --> 00:18:14.690
<b>I'll be the president,</b>

00:18:14.690 --> 00:18:16.150
<b>and you'll be my secretary!</b>

00:18:16.150 --> 00:18:17.610
<b>Wait a minute!</b>

00:18:17.610 --> 00:18:18.740
<b>Why me?</b>

00:18:18.740 --> 00:18:21.690
<b>Because I need you, Rikka!</b>

00:18:21.690 --> 00:18:23.030
<b>With you by my side,</b>

00:18:23.030 --> 00:18:26.710
<b>I feel like I can do the impossible and more!</b>

00:18:27.660 --> 00:18:28.690
<b>Mana...</b>

00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:30.520
<b>Baaaaah!</b>

00:18:30.520 --> 00:18:31.990
<b>Cure Heart!</b>

00:18:35.880 --> 00:18:37.590
<b><i>However you use its power</i></b>

00:18:38.260 --> 00:18:41.170
<b><i>is up for none other than you to decide.</i></b>

00:18:42.220 --> 00:18:44.060
<b>This is my power!</b>

00:18:45.820 --> 00:18:47.460
<b>Selfiiish!</b>

00:18:47.460 --> 00:18:48.840
<b>What's that?</b>

00:18:52.460 --> 00:18:53.640
<b>That light!</b>

00:18:57.180 --> 00:18:58.110
<b>Rikka!</b>

00:18:59.120 --> 00:19:00.480
<b>Raquel! {Yeah, I'll keep this for now too.}</b>

00:19:00.480 --> 00:19:02.820
<b>Place that light inside of me!</b>

00:19:05.200 --> 00:19:06.280
<b>Raquel!</b>

00:19:08.520 --> 00:19:11.400
<b>Precure Love Link!</b>

00:19:12.700 --> 00:19:13.430
<b>L-O-V-E!</b>

00:19:13.430 --> 00:19:14.170
<b>L-O-V-E!</b>

00:19:14.170 --> 00:19:14.900
<b>L-O-V-E!</b>

00:19:14.900 --> 00:19:15.790
<b>L-O-V-E!</b>

00:19:45.630 --> 00:19:47.170
<b>The light of wisdom,</b>

00:19:47.880 --> 00:19:49.500
<b>Cure Diamond!</b>

00:19:52.160 --> 00:19:55.000
<b>I won't allow you to trample upon peoples' hearts!</b>

00:19:55.580 --> 00:19:57.730
<b>I, Cure Diamond,</b>

00:19:57.730 --> 00:20:00.180
<b>shall cool your hot head down! {the language isn't as lofty as I'd like, but it gets the literal meaning across while tying into itself, even if it could flow better.}</b>

00:20:01.010 --> 00:20:02.410
<b>Cure Diamond!</b>

00:20:03.370 --> 00:20:04.880
<b>They got another one?</b>

00:20:04.880 --> 00:20:06.370
<b>Selfish, get her!</b>

00:20:06.370 --> 00:20:07.470
<b>Selfiiish!</b>

00:20:08.290 --> 00:20:10.050
<b><i>My name's Aida Mana!</i></b>

00:20:10.050 --> 00:20:10.750
<b><i>Nice to meet you!</i></b>

00:20:14.390 --> 00:20:16.760
<b><i>With Mana as my wings, I can fly too!</i></b>

00:20:16.760 --> 00:20:18.570
<b><i>No matter how far or high!</i></b>

00:20:21.730 --> 00:20:22.750
<b>Raquel!</b>

00:20:29.050 --> 00:20:30.710
<b>Now, sparkle!</b>

00:20:30.710 --> 00:20:32.480
<b>Twinkle Diamond!</b>

00:20:36.080 --> 00:20:39.390
<b>Love, love, loooove!</b>

00:20:47.100 --> 00:20:48.810
<b>H-Huh?</b>

00:20:57.270 --> 00:20:59.550
<b>Drat! I'll remember this!</b>

00:21:01.050 --> 00:21:02.070
<b>Cure Heart!</b>

00:21:02.070 --> 00:21:02.840
<b>Hm?</b>

00:21:08.550 --> 00:21:09.910
<b>That's good.</b>

00:21:09.910 --> 00:21:13.160
<b>I totally knew you could transform!</b>

00:21:15.230 --> 00:21:17.690
<b>This is a good thing, right?</b>

00:21:17.690 --> 00:21:20.510
<b>Rikka, good luck from here on out.</b>

00:21:21.130 --> 00:21:25.430
<b>Raquel found a partner, so all that's left is Lance!</b>

00:21:28.210 --> 00:21:29.010
<b>Lance?</b>

00:21:29.350 --> 00:21:30.830
<b>Where's Lance?</b>

00:21:31.640 --> 00:21:33.900
<b>Wait, how long has Lance been gone? {I'm reluctant to use pronouns when I don't know its gender}</b>

00:21:33.900 --> 00:21:36.840
<b>Huh? How long...</b>

00:21:36.840 --> 00:21:40.880
<b>I think Lance was with us after school yesterday...</b>

00:21:43.110 --> 00:21:44.440
<b>This is bad!</b>

00:21:44.440 --> 00:21:45.920
<b>Lance is gone!</b>

00:21:52.910 --> 00:21:54.580
<b>You seem to be in trouble.</b>

00:21:56.190 --> 00:21:57.530
<b>Alice!</b>

00:21:58.870 --> 00:22:02.000
<b>Good day, Mana, Rikka.</b>

00:22:03.180 --> 00:22:04.630
<b>Who's that?</b>

00:22:07.740 --> 00:22:11.940
<b>Mana, there is camera footage of you in a Precure's outfit.</b>

00:22:11.940 --> 00:22:13.340
<b>Alice, really?</b>

00:22:13.340 --> 00:22:14.880
<b>What do we do?</b>

00:22:14.880 --> 00:22:18.120
<b>At this rate, the secret of the Precures will be exposed. {dat carsick Mana}</b>

00:22:18.120 --> 00:22:19.250
<b>That's a problem!</b>

00:22:19.250 --> 00:22:23.150
<b>As such, I shall be your Precure Producer!</b>

00:22:23.150 --> 00:22:24.790
<b>P-Producer?</b>

00:22:25.620 --> 00:22:26.690
<b><i>Dokidoki Precure</i>:</b>

00:22:27.260 --> 00:22:31.260
<b>I Must Refuse!

00:22:27.260 --> 00:22:31.260
<b>I Must Refuse!

00:22:31.500 --> 00:22:33.660
<b>That knot in your heart won't come undone!</b>
